es, and epic loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff0 <strong>Sieges &amp; World Events</strong> \u2013 Unleash massive battles where factions clash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Play in Your Own World</strong> \u2013 Experience your creation as a player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Share Worlds Online</strong> \u2013 Compete in leaderboards, showcase your creativity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Mod Support &amp; Dev Toolkit</strong> \u2013 Add your own models, icons, effects, animations, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/Characters.png?t=1743944226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a game dev, a worldbuilder, or just someone who\u2019s always dreamed of making the perfect MMO\u2014<strong>MMORPG DEV Tycoon</strong> puts that power in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build. Watch. Play. Evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/Screen_3.png?t=1743944226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add to your <strong>Wishlist now</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/extras/addToWishlistAndFollow.gif?t=1743944226\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And follow the Development on YouTube @Elindery</p>","developers":["Elindery"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2196340/header.jpg?t=1743944226","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu Linux, version 10.10 or later<br></